CPF and CNPJ Tools
******************

This manual documents ‘cpf-tools’, an Emacs package for generating,
validating, and formatting Brazilian CPF and CNPJ numbers.

* Menu:

* Overview::             What cpf-tools does.
* Installation::         How to install the package.
* Usage::                Commands and functions reference.


File: cpf-tools.info,  Node: Overview,  Next: Installation,  Prev: Top,  Up: Top

1 Overview
**********

‘cpf-tools’ provides utilities for working with Brazilian personal (CPF)
and corporate (CNPJ) tax identification numbers.  Features include:
   • Generating valid CPF and CNPJ numbers (with prefix arguments for
     insertion or formatting).
   • Validating CPF and CNPJ numbers.
   • Formatting text regions containing CPF or CNPJ numbers.
   • Completing incomplete CPF and CNPJ patterns containing wildcards
     (‘*’ or ‘?’).


