2 Installation
**************

You can install ‘cpf-tools’ from MELPA or directly from source:

   • Using ‘use-package’ and ‘:vc’:
          (use-package cpf-tools
            :ensure t
            :vc (:url "https://github.com/jjnilton/cpf-tools" :rev :newest))
   • Using ‘package-install-file’:
          M-x package-install-file RET cpf-tools.el RET


